msgstr "医学実験室のカードキーを手に入れた\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_037"
msgid "Who are you?\\n"
msgstr "お前は誰だ？\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_038"
msgid "Hey - you've got my clothes.\\n"
msgstr "こら、それはオレの服だぞ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_039"
msgid "Help - help!\\n"
msgstr "助けて、助けてくれ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_040"
msgid "Don't shoot me!\\n"
msgstr "撃たないで！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_041"
msgid "Oh, my God - a gun!\\n"
msgstr "何てこった、銃だ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_042"
msgid "There's an intruder in the complex.\\n"
msgstr "ビル内に侵入者発見！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_043"
msgid "Give me back my clothes - or else!\\n"
msgstr "すぐに返さなきゃ、イタイ目にあうそ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_044"
msgid "Right - you've asked for it!\\n"
msgstr "よーし、そっちがその気なら！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_045"
msgid "Give me my clothes.\\n"
msgstr "さっさと服を返せ…\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_046"
msgid "I don't have much time!!!\\n"
msgstr "バレる前に急がなきゃ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_047"
msgid "The enemy has discovered the disguise.\\n"
msgstr "ユニフォームを奪ったことが発覚した\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_048"
msgid "Virus has already been downloaded.\\n"
msgstr "ウイルスは既にセットされています\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_049"
msgid "Initiating virus download.\\n"
msgstr "コンピュータウイルスのセット開始\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_050"
msgid "So, you got here at last.\\n"
msgstr "来たか、おそかったな。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_051"
msgid "Hey, you're not... SECURITY ALERT!\\n"
msgstr "おい、お前は…　アラームをならせ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_052"
msgid "No guns allowed in here - put your weapon away.\\n"
msgstr "ここには武器は持ちこみ禁止だ。銃を収めろ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_053"
msgid "I won't tell you again - lose the weapon.\\n"
msgstr "もう２度と言わないぞ！　銃を収めるんだ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_054"
msgid "Right - I'm calling security.\\n"
msgstr "よろしい、では警備を呼ばせてもらおう\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_055"
msgid "Everyone's been waiting for you...\\n"
msgstr "みんな君を待ってたんだぞ\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_056"
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な人物が倒された\\n"

