msgstr "ふーん、シャワー室か。そうそう、\\nここになら、ユニフォームがあるかも…\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_079"
msgid "The temperature's dropping... You must be \\nclose to the cryo room.\\n"
msgstr "温度が下がってきているようだ。\\n冷凍カプセルは近いぞ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_080"
msgid ""
"The air's heavily recycled around here - must\\n be near the autopsy lab.\\n"
msgstr "エチルアルコールのにおい…。\\n医学実験室はこの近くね。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_081"
msgid "There he is, Jo! Hurry or you'll be too late!\\n"
msgstr "よーしここだ、ジョアンナ！\\n急がないと手遅れになるぞ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_082"
msgid "Leave this area now.\\n"
msgstr "オイ！勝手に入るんじゃない！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_083"
msgid "Should you be in here?\\n"
msgstr "ここの担当か？\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_084"
msgid "Holy...\\n"
msgstr "お、お前は…\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_085"
msgid "It's a spy!\\n"
msgstr "こいつ、スパイだ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_086"
msgid "Warn the others...\\n"
msgstr "アラームを！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_087"
msgid "Imposter!\\n"
msgstr "何者だ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_088"
msgid "Lighting systems overloaded.\\n"
msgstr "照明システムがオーバーロードした\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_089"
msgid "Alternative entrance to medlabs created.\\n"
msgstr "もう一つの方法で侵入ルートを作った\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_090"
msgid ""
"The problem you have is that there is no \\nway to sneak into the research "
"section. \\nThe only way in available to you is a \\nweak section of wall "
"I've marked in the \\nroom beyond the stores. It can be destroyed \\nwith "
"explosives.\\n"
msgstr "この先に侵入するには\\n壁を壊すしかない。\\np倉庫の奥のモロい所に\\nマークをつけておいた。\\np爆破して侵入するんだ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_091"
msgid "Doesn't sound like a problem to me. Where \\nare these explosives?\\n"
msgstr "全く問題ないわ。ところで\\n「爆薬」はどこにあるの？\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_092"
msgid "In that crate.\\n"
msgstr "このコンテナの中さ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_093"
msgid "Cute. Very cute.\\n"
msgstr "ふ～ん、なかなかキュートじゃない。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_094"
msgid ""
"By the way, the stores are crawling with \\nguards. It may go against your "
"nature, but \\ntry sneaking through rather than blasting \\neverything.\\n"
msgstr "倉庫には警備兵がウジャウジャいる。\\np何でも撃ちまくるんじゃなくて\\n静かに潜入するんだ、いいな。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_095"
msgid "Certainly. Any other pearls of wisdom?\\n"
msgstr "はいはい。\\n他に「オ・コ・ト・バ」はあって？\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_096"
msgid "That crate...\\n"
msgstr "うん？　このコンテナだが…\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_097"
msgid "Yes?\\n"
msgstr "な～に？\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_098"
msgid "It really doesn't like being shot.\\n"
msgstr "コイツは撃たれるのがキライらしいぜ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_099"
msgid ""
"Great. Now, if I can just fight the urge \\nto report him to Base "
"Security...\\n"
msgstr "なによ！　エラそうに…。\\n警備兵にチクッてやろうかしら…\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_100"
msgid "Put your hands up and step away from the \\nalien.\\n"
msgstr "手を上げて！\\nそこから離れなさい！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_101"
msgid ""
"What the hell do you think you're doing? \\nThis is supposed to be a sealed "
"room! \\nDon't you know anything about autopsy \\nprocedures?\\n"
msgstr "一体何のマネだ？　ここは\\n超極秘エリアなんだぞ！！\\np検死の手続きを知らないのか！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_102"
msgid "Don't make me tell you again, Doctor. And \\nturn that laser off.\\n"
msgstr "何度も言わせないで！\\nさっさとレーザーを切るのよ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_103"
msgid "Director Easton will hear about this, \\nyoung lady.\\n"
msgstr "イーストン司令にバレたら\\nタダでは済まないぞ！\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_104"
msgid ""
"Of course he's going to hear of it, you \\nmoron. I've just got into his top"
" secret \\nbase, and now I'm stealing his alien.\\n"
msgstr "ええ、もちろん聞くことになるでしょうよ。\\n私が超極秘の基地に潜入して、エイリアンを\\nを盗んだってことをね。\\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_105"
msgid "Automatic Defenses Disabled.\\n"
msgstr "自動警備システムを破壊した\\n"
